        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All powers from the begginig; different ways to face the danger. Gravity Storm: First Mission is an action platformer, where the main mechanics are shooting, dashing and of course flipping gravity. You can also have the <strong>super system</strong>, which gives you access to more powerful versions of your main abilities, allowing you to deal massive damage, stun enmies, or even turning yourself into a destructive fire ball. Although this game can be played casually, it has a high skill ceiling for those who wish to speedrun it or get high scores. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES AND GAME MODES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad and </strong>keyboard support (Xbox and ps4/5). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 levels and 6 bosses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra modes</strong>: level select, illustrations viewer (with fanart included), boss rush, custom mode where you can get infinate healh, randomize enemies and levels, add permanet death etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remappable buttons</strong>/key bindings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score system and time attack</strong> integrated in the main campaign. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Options to toggle</strong> vibration, screen-shake, dialogue, and tutorial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio options</strong>: master volume, sfx volume, music volume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> for speedruner and score hunters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All powers from the begginig; different ways to face the danger. Gravity Storm: First Mission is an action platformer, where the main mechanics are shooting, dashing and of course flipping gravity. You can also have the <strong>super system</strong>, which gives you access to more powerful versions of your main abilities, allowing you to deal massive damage, stun enmies, or even turning yourself into a destructive fire ball. Although this game can be played casually, it has a high skill ceiling for those who wish to speedrun it or get high scores. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES AND GAME MODES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad and </strong>keyboard support (Xbox and ps4/5). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 levels and 6 bosses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extra modes</strong>: level select, illustrations viewer (with fanart included), boss rush, custom mode where you can get infinate healh, randomize enemies and levels, add permanet death etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remappable buttons</strong>/key bindings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score system and time attack</strong> integrated in the main campaign. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Options to toggle</strong> vibration, screen-shake, dialogue, and tutorial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio options</strong>: master volume, sfx volume, music volume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards</strong> for speedruner and score hunters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Break the laws of physics, dash and shoot your way through levels full of hazards and machines gone rogue. In this retro game, you control Project Gravity Storm, an advanced machine able to control gravity itself; however, the mother computer will not make things easy for you.",
